ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Sila ay makakasama sa dispatch o doon sa mga ipapatakbo ng SO na mga planta.

asr-001999
01:49:27.840 --> 01:49:37.740
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Pero po ang bayaran sa kanila ay hindi base doon sa presyo necessarily na lalabas sa merkado dahil yung mga ibang generators dito ay contracted bilaterally.

asr-002000
01:49:37.740 --> 01:49:50.600
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kaya't yung kanilang naibentang or naisupply na kuryente during that interval, kung pwedeng ang presyo niyan ay yung kanilang bilateral contract with an off-taker and it will be settled.

asr-002001
01:49:50.720 --> 01:49:58.880
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At pagdating naman po sa offers natin, wala po tayo yung nire-require na yung kanilang offer ay dapat base doon sa kanilang cost.

asr-002002
01:49:59.400 --> 01:50:13.320
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ito po ay kanilang desisyon na kung ano ang kanilang i-offer but normally in a competitive market, kung ikaw ay mag-offer at ang gusto mo ay makabawi ng at least yung marginal cost.

asr-002003
01:50:13.320 --> 01:50:19.880
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: So mag-offer ka ng at least yung fuel and operating cost.

asr-002004
01:50:20.720 --> 01:50:30.180
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ay mabawi mo itong gagastusin mo kapag ka ikaw ay natawag at nag-generate ng kuryente, yung iyong capital cost maaaring hindi mo mabawi.

asr-002005
01:50:30.180 --> 01:50:46.400
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Pero during times naman na yung mag-clear na presyo ay mas mataas kaysa doon sa marginal cost mo at mas mataas kaysa dito na meron pang kasama na po pwedeng makarecover ka ng capital fee mo or cost mo, doon yung mga panahon na ikaw ay nakakarecover.

asr-002006
01:50:46.400 --> 01:50:50.400
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kaya't meron po tayong mga ilang coal plants na maaaring ang kanilang...

asr-002007
01:50:50.720 --> 01:51:08.940
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ang presyo during the time na sila ay nakasama doon sa dispatch schedule ay mas mataas kaysa doon sa kanilang all-in na presyo nasa 6 o 7 dahil ang nag-clear na presyo ay mas mataas dito, mabot ng 32 which is our primary cap in WESM.

asr-002008
01:51:08.940 --> 01:51:18.540
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Pero hindi necessarily na yun ang ibabayad sa kanila dahil po maaaring sila naman as sa baseload plants, kakailanganin naman po nila ng kontrata.

asr-002009
01:51:18.540 --> 01:51:29.560
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Nang sa ganon, masisiguro nila na lagi silang kinakailangan tumakbo dahil hindi naman po sila po pwede na magpatay sinde ng kanilang planta at ito naman po ang makakapekto sa operasyon nila.

asr-002010
01:51:29.660 --> 01:51:37.400
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kaya't sisiguruhin nila na sila ay lagi makakasama doon sa dispatch dahil sila ay meron mga kontrata rin na kailangan servisyohan po.

asr-002011
01:51:37.400 --> 01:51:42.780
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Tama po kayo pero will you agree with me na this is all market driven?

asr-002012
01:51:43.540 --> 01:51:47.220
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kung ano kasi the demand is great?

asr-002013
01:51:47.420 --> 01:51:48.400
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Talagang tumakbo.

asr-002014
01:51:48.540 --> 01:52:03.920
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Maski hindi naman po kinakailangan, wala pong iniwan. Parang po karne ng manok, karne ng baboy. May African swine fever isang lugar pero kailangan mo magdala doon dahil walang supply ng baboy so tataas ang baboy when in fact it's not supposed to.

asr-002015
01:52:03.920 --> 01:52:13.940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Or isang lugar na galunggong is so mura dahil walang supply ng galunggong pero may dumating na galunggong so tataas yung presyo because the demand is great.

asr-002016
01:52:13.940 --> 01:52:31.980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung po yung sinasabi ko Chairperson Juan and Madam Secretary, we have to check itong WESM. So po pwede ho eh kung titignan ho natin, pag-aralan lang ho siguro ninyo, take time na pag-aralan ho itong po ang problema natin sa generation, hindi po sa distribution.

asr-002017
01:52:31.980 --> 01:52:51.540
Senator Erwin Tulfo: It's not Meralco, it's not Samelco, it's not the cooperative but the generator yung nagpo-produce ng kuryente para for distribution. Doon po ang problema because sobrang sipa ng presyo kagaya po niyan, full siya but then again parang banker fuel ang presyo niya.

asr-002018
01:52:51.540 --> 01:53:00.700
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Sa sabihin po, barko. Kailangan pumantay dahil doon sa fuel ng barko kaya sobrang taas. Masyado pong exorbitant.

asr-002019
01:53:00.700 --> 01:53:30.260
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I think once in a while you have to look into this siguro Atty. Juan kasi parang ang kawaba po dito yung mga tao. Kailangan lang po nalaga natin, imonitor siguro Atty. Juan para ikang pag-alam ng WESM na minomonitor sila, chinecheck sila, then siyempre magdadahan-dahan kasi po kailangan po natin ang goal po natin lahat tayo dito, si Chairperson Pia, si Senate President, we're all looking for ways.

asr-002020
01:53:30.260 --> 01:53:47.960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: How to bring our electricity rate down. Lahat naman po tayo kasi tayo po pinakamahal sa Southeast Asia. I mean meron naman pa lang, meron pong pamamaraan. I know there's a way. If we just look, we just do natin simulan sa power generation.

asr-002021
01:53:48.140 --> 01:53:57.900
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Huwag po natin sisihin ang Meralco, huwag po natin sisihin itong mga electric cooperatives dahil bumibili lang po sila ng power. Yung po nagma-manufacture. Doon po yun eh.

asr-002022
01:53:57.900 --> 01:54:26.780
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kasi 4 pesos, 5 pesos versus bunker fuel. I understand what Secretary Garin is saying. Noong nagkagira, tataas talaga pero coal galing ng Jakarta, coal galing ng Semirara dyan sa Antique. Why don't we use all this para po bumaba yung presyo natin? Siguro we can do something about it. That's all for me for now, Chairperson Pia. Thank you for your forgiveness.

asr-002023
01:54:26.780 --> 01:54:45.880
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: I understand because the WESM is really unusually high now. We anticipated that also. Ang problema kasi talaga, it's unregulated ang generation. So maybe once we revisit the EPIRA, we have to do something about it.

asr-002024
01:54:45.880 --> 01:54:55.840
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: But for now, Madam Chair, when the war happened, we did an intervention because of the emergency powers. We had a mandate. Nag-suspend kami ng market.

asr-002025
01:54:56.780 --> 01:55:19.140
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Para yung mauna yung mga mas mura mabenta. So we've been studying this. Actually, we just had a meeting yesterday na rin kung ano pang pwedeng intervention. But good enough, ERC already issued a price cap. So from 18 magiging 11 na lang yata siya. Magiging 8 pesos.

asr-002026
01:55:19.140 --> 01:55:26.600
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: But still, the abuse of the market should not. Because these are public service.

asr-002027
01:55:26.780 --> 01:55:45.380
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: So in fact, hindi lang coal, Madam Chairman, kundi pati hydro, naging mahal na rin because they know there's lack of supply. So they can sell whatever they sell. So medyo may abuse rin. And we're checking what are the recourse na pwede natin gawin to put discipline in the market also.

asr-002028
01:55:45.380 --> 01:55:55.360
Senator Erwin Tulfo: May pahabol ako, Madam Chairperson. Thank you po, Attorney Juan, for doing that. It's ika nga kahit papaano, you're looking for ways right now para matulungan po ang kababayan natin.

asr-002029
01:55:56.780 --> 01:56:23.660
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kasi yung mga arawan po ng mga kababayan natin, minimum wage below minimum wage. Parang hirap po magbayad ng kuryente. And kuryente should not be. It is already a necessity, hindi po luxury. Siguro noong dekada 80, noong college tayo, Secretary Garin, luxury ang kuryente. Pero ngayon po, it's a necessity. Kahit na po yung nakatira sa barong-barong, kailangan niya ng kuryente. Thank you, Madam Chair. Thank you po.

asr-002030
01:56:23.660 --> 01:56:26.000
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Thank you.

asr-002031
