asr-003839
03:04:21.540 --> 03:04:22.460
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Pumayag na sila.

asr-003840
03:04:23.000 --> 03:04:24.460
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Ang gobyerno nalang.

asr-003841
03:04:24.560 --> 03:04:25.320
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Magbibuild up.

asr-003842
03:04:25.400 --> 03:04:27.760
