asr-004369
03:28:22.320 --> 03:28:23.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So congratulations

asr-004370
03:28:23.600 --> 03:28:25.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: for that. I mean, it's not just something

asr-004371
03:28:25.860 --> 03:28:27.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: atin lang kasi the same

asr-004372
03:28:27.780 --> 03:28:29.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: way we're so affected by what happens

asr-004373
03:28:29.640 --> 03:28:31.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: globally, yun nga yung pagbabaan ng presyo

asr-004374
03:28:31.620 --> 03:28:33.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: ng battery, ng solar,

asr-004375
